<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     HEADER
════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="report-header">
  <div class="label">Management Analytics Report</div>
  <h1>Amazon Product Catalog Performance &amp; Customer Sentiment Analysis</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">A data-driven examination of 1,465 Amazon India products covering pricing strategies, discount effectiveness, customer ratings, and category-level performance.</div>
  <div class="report-meta">
    <span>&#128197; April 21, 2026</span>
    <span>&#128202; 1,465 Products Analyzed</span>
    <span>&#127758; Amazon India Marketplace</span>
    <span>&#127919; Audience: Product &amp; Category Management</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">

<!-- TOC -->
<div class="toc">
  <h3>Table of Contents</h3>
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#executive">Executive Overview</a></li>
    <li><a href="#category">Category Performance Breakdown</a></li>
    <li><a href="#pricing">Pricing &amp; Discount Strategy Analysis</a></li>
    <li><a href="#engagement">Customer Engagement &amp; Rating Distribution</a></li>
    <li><a href="#sentiment">Review Sentiment Snapshot</a></li>
    <li><a href="#recommendations">Strategic Recommendations</a></li>
  </ol>
</div>

<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     1. EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW
════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section" id="executive">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">1</div>
    <h2>Executive Overview</h2>
  </div>

  <!-- KPI DASHBOARD -->
  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card blue">
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg Product Rating</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">4.10</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">on a 1–5 scale</div>
      <div class="kpi-badge">&#9733; Strong</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card green">
      <div class="kpi-label">High-Rating Share</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">75.8%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">products rated ≥ 4.0</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card amber">
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg Discount</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">47.7%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">median: 50%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card teal">
      <div class="kpi-label">Median Rating Count</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">5,179</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">reviews per product</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card red">
      <div class="kpi-label">Disc–Rating Correlation</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">−0.16</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">weak negative link</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="insight-box">
    <strong>Headline Finding</strong>
    Three-quarters of the catalog earns a 4.0+ rating — a strong quality signal. However, deeper discounts show a <em>weak negative</em> correlation with ratings (r = −0.16), meaning aggressive price cuts do not translate into higher customer satisfaction and may be eroding margin unnecessarily.
  </div>

  <div class="chart-grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Category Share of Catalog</h3>
      <canvas id="catShareChart" height="220"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Average Rating by Top-Level Category</h3>
      <canvas id="catRatingChart" height="220"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     2. CATEGORY PERFORMANCE
════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section" id="category">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-num">2</div>
    <h2>Category Performance Breakdown</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Category Avg Rating vs Avg Discount % (bubble = product count)</h3>
      <canvas id="catBubbleChart" height="260"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Total Customer Reviews by Category</h3>
      <canvas id="catReviewsChart" height="260"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h3>Full Category Scorecard</h3>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Category</th>
            <th>Products</th>
            <th>Avg Rating</th>
            <th>Avg Discount</th>
            <th>Avg Rating Count</th>
            <th>Total Reviews</th>
            <th>Rating Tier</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Office Products</strong></td>
            <td>31</td>
            <td><span class="rating-pill rating-high">4.31 ★</span></td>
            <td><span class="disc-badge">12%</span></td>
            <td>4,828</td>
            <td>149,675</td>
            <td><span class="kpi-badge">Top</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Computers &amp; Accessories</strong></td>
            <td>453</td>
            <td><span class="rating-pill rating-high">4.15 ★</span></td>
            <td><span class="disc-badge">54%</span></td>
            <td>17,137</td>
            <td>7,728,689</td>
            <td><span class="kpi-badge">High</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Electronics</strong></td>
            <td>526</td>
            <td><span class="rating-pill rating-high">4.08 ★</span></td>
            <td><span class="disc-badge">51%</span></td>
            <td>29,998</td>
            <td>15,778,848</td>
            <td><span class="kpi-badge">High</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Home &amp; Kitchen</strong></td>
            <td>448</td>
            <td><span class="rating-pill rating-mid">4.04 ★</span></td>
            <td><span class="disc-badge">40%</span></td>
            <td>6,676</td>
            <td>2,991,069</td>
            <td><span class="kpi-badge" style="background:#fef9c3;color:#713f12;">Mid</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Musical Instruments</td>
            <td>2</td>
            <td><span class="rating-pill rating-mid">3.90 ★</span></td>
            <td><span class="disc-badge">46%</span></td>
            <td>44,441</td>
            <td>88,882</td>
            <td><span class="neg-badge">Low</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Car &amp; Motorbike</td>
            <td>1</td>
            <td><span class="rating-pill rating-mid">3.80 ★</span></td>
            <td><span class="disc-badge">42%</span></td>
            <td>1,118</td>
            <td>1,118</td>
            <td><span class="neg-badge">Low</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="insight-box warning">
    <strong>Spotlight: Office Products Outperforms Despite Low Discounts</strong>
    Office Products carries the highest average rating (4.31) while offering the lowest average discount (12%). This suggests strong intrinsic product quality — a model category for margin efficiency.
  </div>

  <div class="insight-box">
